<p class="eyebrow">NIT3112 · LAB ASSESSMENT 2</p><h1>QuTech administration</h1>
<section class="panel prose"><h2>Service management with a clear record</h2><p>QuTech is expanding its SaaS offering with flexible subscription plans and modular services. This administration prototype brings customer contacts, plan configuration, usage, billing and audit information together.</p><h2>Lab 2 scope</h2><p>This project demonstrates the MVC structure, model relationships, Razor pages and server-side validation using fictional data. Forms validate submitted input and show a preview. No changes are saved.</p><p>Authentication, access control, database persistence, payment processing, automated invoicing and automatic audit capture are future Lab 3 work. This local demonstration has no sign-in protection.</p><h2>Project details</h2><dl class="details"><div><dt>Student</dt><dd>Justin Lee</dd></div><div><dt>Project</dt><dd>JustinLee-Lab2</dd></div><div><dt>Teaching sources</dt><dd>NIT3112 Week 1–2, Sessions 1–6</dd></div></dl></section>
